# ============================================================
# Outside Lobbying in Statehouses — .gitignore
# ============================================================

# ------ R / RStudio user files ------
.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata

# ------ Data (lives in shared Dropbox, not Git) ------
Initial Data/
Processed Data/
*.csv
*.dta
*.RData
*.rda
*.rds
*.parquet

# ------ Literature & meeting notes (lives in Dropbox) ------
Literature/
Meetings and Feedback/

# ------ Generated output (regenerate from code) ------
# Uncomment the next two lines if you want figures rebuilt
# from code rather than version-controlled:
# Figures and Tables/
# *.png

# ------ renv (track lockfile, not installed packages) ------
renv/library/
renv/staging/
renv/sandbox/
renv/cellar/
renv/local/
renv/lock/
renv/python/

# ------ OS junk ------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ------ Editor / IDE ------
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
